title: Where the savings go
currency: AUD
capital: 300000
horizon_years: 10
as_of: 2026-09-24
assumptions:
  inflation_pct: 3.0
  tax_rate_pct: 32.0
benchmark: bank
options:
  - id: bank
    label: Term deposit
    capital: 300000
    growth_pct: 0
    flows:
      - {label: Interest, direction: in, amount: 13500, growth_pct: 0, taxable: true}
    exit: {sell: true, cost_pct: 0}
    effort_hours_per_week: 0
    risk: low
    liquidity: days
    note: Rolls over every 12 months.
  - id: unit
    label: A one-bedroom unit, rented out
    capital: 150000
    loan: {amount: 450000, rate_pct: 6.1, term_years: 30, interest_only: false}
    growth_pct: 4.0
    flows:
      - {label: Rent, direction: in, amount: 26000, growth_pct: 3, taxable: true}
      - {label: Loan repayments, direction: out, amount: 32700}
      - {label: Strata, rates and insurance, direction: out, amount: 7400, growth_pct: 4}
      - {label: Letting fee, direction: out, amount: 1800, growth_pct: 3}
      - {label: Vacancy and repairs, direction: out, schedule: [3000, 2000, 2000, 2000, 6000, 2000, 2000, 2000, 2000, 6000]}
    exit: {sell: true, cost_pct: 3.5}
    effort_hours_per_week: 1
    risk: medium
    liquidity: months
    note: Land tax starts once the holding passes the threshold.
  - id: business
    label: The fit-out business, run by me
    capital: 120000
    growth_pct: 0
    flows:
      - {label: Revenue, direction: in, schedule: [40000, 140000, 260000, 340000, 380000, 400000, 420000, 440000, 460000, 480000], taxable: true}
      - {label: Cost of delivery, direction: out, schedule: [22000, 77000, 143000, 187000, 209000, 220000, 231000, 242000, 253000, 264000]}
      - {label: Rent and overheads, direction: out, amount: 48000, growth_pct: 3}
      - {label: First hire, direction: out, amount: 78000, growth_pct: 3, start_year: 3}
      - {label: Setup loan repayments, direction: out, amount: 14000, start_year: 1, end_year: 5}
    exit: {sell: false, cost_pct: 0}
    effort_hours_per_week: 45
    risk: high
    liquidity: years
    note: The 45 hours a week are not in any flow — a wage forgone elsewhere is the real cost.
